/-!
# Localized variance bounds for order-two U-statistics

This barrel collects a finite-product coordinate calculus, covariance-overlap
bounds, and real and extended-nonnegative localized variance inequalities for
symmetric unordered order-two U-statistics.  The bounds retain both the
one-coordinate row-mass scale and the two-coordinate pair-mass scale.
-/
